## Adding a part later

The feature installs once per project, so a second run to add a part fails. To add a part by hand, copy its template files from `node_modules/nx-fhir/src/generators/feature-otel/files/`:

<% if (!dashboard) { -%>
- Dashboard: copy `dashboard/grafana/` to `otel/grafana/`.
<% } -%>
<% if (!compose) { -%>
- Docker Compose: copy `compose/docker-compose.otel.yml.template` to the project root and `compose/otel/otelcol-filter.yaml.template` to `otel/`.<% if (!serve) { %> Copy `otel/agent.properties.template` to `otel/`.<% } %>
<% } -%>
<% if (!serve) { -%>
- nx serve: set `features.otel.options.serve` to `true` in `project.json`, because `nx serve --otel` checks it.<% if (!compose) { %> Copy `otel/agent.properties.template` to `otel/`.<% } %>
<% } -%>

Remove the `.template` suffix from each file name and replace `__serviceName__` in file names with `<%= serviceName %>`. In the file contents, replace each `<%%= name %>` placeholder with its value and resolve each `<%% if ... %>` block.
